    "preamble": "Taher Ibrahim Tajmahal vs State Of Gujarat on 22 April, 2018 Author: B.N. Karia Bench: B.N. Karia R/Cr.Ra/420/2017 Order",
    "facts": "Today, Mr. J. A. Salunke, Food Safety Officer (I.D.Card No. 14794, issued by Surat Municipal Corporation) is present before this Court stating that as the matter is placed in the Lok Adalat before this Court, and if the applicant is ready and willing to deposit the amount of fine, let the matter be disposed of. Mr. Salunke states that the original complainant-Ranjitlal Umeshchand Shah, Food Inspector has retired from the services and he has been authorized by the designated officer and on this behalf, a letter of authority has been issued in his favour to remain present R/CR.RA/420/2017 ORDER before this Court. The said letter of authority issued by the designated officer, Surat Municipal Corporatino as well as withdrawal/settlement pursis is taken on record.",
